@startuml
' A note on a transition (`note on link`) stands under its words, in
' the room the layout keeps for them: in a block or on its line, and on
' a transition into a state's inside too.
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Busy : start
note on link
  counts the jobs
  as they come
end note
Busy --> Idle : done
note on link : back to rest
state Busy {
  [*] --> Working
  Working --> Checking
  note on link : each one
}
Checking --> Idle : fail
note on link : a crossing
@enduml
